Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.84,0:00:35.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.40,0:00:39.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.56,0:01:32.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.14,0:01:59.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lilimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.44,0:02:02.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Azuroman!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.92,0:02:05.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goronamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.68,0:02:10.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gabumon, walk Digimon, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.12,0:02:12.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gabumon, walk Digimon, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.82,0:02:16.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.08,0:02:18.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.14,0:02:19.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.46,0:02:23.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, two, three, four!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.32,0:02:32.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, digital monsters,\NDigimon are the champions
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.60,0:02:39.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,MetalGarurumon and Greymon, Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.38,0:02:46.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're back!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.34,0:02:48.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.86,0:02:53.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're dealing with the new and improved\NDigidestined. That's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.98,0:02:56.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you DigiPol without your crests?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.24,0:02:59.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing's impossible, at least not when\Nyou've got your friends helping you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.80,0:03:00.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said it, Matt!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.36,0:03:04.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, time to fight! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.24,0:03:27.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There too come!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.84,0:03:29.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vulcan's Hammer!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.52,0:03:33.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.43,0:03:34.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your hammer nailed it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.66,0:03:37.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can help out too,\Nright, Lillymon? Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.82,0:03:39.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on for a while!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.48,0:03:41.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flower Cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.94,0:03:47.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next time, Lillymon, can you\Nuse someone else as a boomerang?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.20,0:03:50.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I wanted to make\Nsure you came back to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.66,0:03:51.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vulcan's Hammer!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.12,0:03:55.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai, now's your chance to go for his body!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.56,0:03:57.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.26,0:04:01.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe, Mimi, look out behind you! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.60,0:04:03.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gate of Destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.44,0:04:07.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Celestial Arrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.14,0:04:11.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.86,0:04:13.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're here to protect you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.18,0:04:16.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll go for the other\Nclaws, too! Thanks, Cory!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.32,0:04:17.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We owe you one!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.50,0:04:19.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt, this is better than any video game!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.02,0:04:21.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll say... Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.48,0:04:23.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flower Cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.56,0:04:28.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, why should you guys have all the fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.20,0:04:29.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Save some for me and Izzy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.28,0:04:35.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll distract Apocalymon while Matt\Nand Tai concentrate on attacking!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.44,0:04:36.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch our backs!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.64,0:04:38.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's end this, virus grenade!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.82,0:04:42.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mega Centarumon, protect Sora! Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.48,0:04:44.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Winged Bride!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.14,0:04:51.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.94,0:04:53.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Giga Saturn!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.94,0:04:57.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's my turn, Horn Buster!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.12,0:05:01.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Attack! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.82,0:05:03.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Metal Wolf Claw!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.30,0:05:06.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Terra Force!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.42,0:05:14.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.86,0:05:16.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We destroyed all of his claws!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.00,0:05:18.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still think you're so tough?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.94,0:05:21.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that your best shot?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.68,0:05:22.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know you're beaten!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.92,0:05:23.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Face it like a mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.00,0:05:25.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think so, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.42,0:05:28.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I may be beaten, but\NI won't go down that easily!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.32,0:05:30.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take you and both worlds with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.28,0:05:32.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.19,0:05:34.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You still haven't seen my ultimate attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.34,0:05:36.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Total annihilation!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.46,0:05:40.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gonna destroy everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.36,0:05:41.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They should've made out my will!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.04,0:05:43.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm too good-looking to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.62,0:05:44.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want my mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.92,0:05:46.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There must be a solution!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.68,0:05:47.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We won't give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.80,0:05:50.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're stronger than he is! We're a team!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.80,0:05:52.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.46,0:05:54.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, we're the Digidestined!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.98,0:06:19.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.32,0:06:21.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure What\Nhappened to the explosion?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.02,0:06:25.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was completely contained\Nby the power of our digivices.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.40,0:06:27.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.66,0:06:29.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We actually won. Looks that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.92,0:06:31.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me while I throw up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.60,0:06:33.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess we saved the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.56,0:06:35.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.04,0:06:37.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did it! You're amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.18,0:06:41.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remind me to call you the next time\NI have trouble with my landlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.26,0:06:42.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.90,0:06:43.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.81,0:06:44.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.73,0:06:46.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I did have some help, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.94,0:07:06.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.34,0:07:08.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.22,0:07:14.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A New World!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.88,0:07:24.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.06,0:07:26.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forgot to set my alarm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.38,0:07:27.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it over? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.02,0:07:30.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what's gonna happen\Nto the digital world now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.06,0:07:32.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See for yourselves. Look down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.42,0:07:34.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.70,0:07:38.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's File Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.14,0:07:42.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ancient prophecy said that\Nafter the great darkness is over,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.86,0:07:45.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the first thing to be\Nreborn will be the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.32,0:07:48.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And from that island will\Ncome the land and the seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.80,0:07:50.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but what does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.78,0:07:54.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It means that the Digi-World will\Nstart over from the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.20,0:07:56.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.12,0:08:01.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Digi-World is being reborn, as\Nare all the Digimon from the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.32,0:08:03.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna need a lot of diapers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.10,0:08:03.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.38,0:08:06.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, let's go! Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.10,0:08:08.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the primary village.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.08,0:08:10.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And everything's back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.04,0:08:12.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like it's starting to rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.40,0:08:16.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A digi-egg storm!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.54,0:08:19.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, those eggs are my responsibility!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.20,0:08:21.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna count them all?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.00,0:08:22.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.91,0:08:25.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You never count your\Ndigi-eggs before they hatch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.26,0:08:26.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.22,0:08:27.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Helping these digi-eggs hatch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.26,0:08:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna hatch them all?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.68,0:08:30.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you suggest?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.94,0:08:31.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We make an omelet?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.90,0:08:33.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course we're going to hatch them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.84,0:08:36.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The future of the\Ndigi-world depends on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.08,0:08:37.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.06,0:08:39.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.16,0:08:40.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just rub them gently.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.88,0:08:41.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.22,0:08:44.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should be done in about 60 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.46,0:08:47.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This means Leomon will\Nbe reborn. That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.42,0:08:50.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Piximon, Whamon, and Wizardmon, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.64,0:08:51.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.84,0:08:57.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should take a picture to commemorate\Nthis special occasion. A picture? Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.32,0:08:58.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.52,0:08:59.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.43,0:09:01.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great, I'll go get TK and Kari then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.14,0:09:03.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll shine my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.98,0:09:07.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, we're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.30,0:09:08.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say cheese!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.46,0:09:11.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.54,0:09:15.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.78,0:09:18.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, it hatched! It's so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.36,0:09:25.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm outta here! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.30,0:09:28.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean you're leaving?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.26,0:09:29.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to hit the road!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.88,0:09:30.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a hike!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.79,0:09:32.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make like a tree and leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.34,0:09:35.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Ochre-mon, why not stay here with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.42,0:09:37.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, I'm a virus-type Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.52,0:09:39.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys are data and vaccine types.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.86,0:09:43.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I hang around here too long,\NI'll get sick to my stomach!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.34,0:09:44.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Catch you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.16,0:09:47.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He vanished!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.30,0:09:50.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He just can't face the\Nfact that he likes us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.52,0:09:53.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, I've never heard of a virus\Ngiving someone a cold shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.64,0:09:54.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.80,0:09:58.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you remember the day the Dramon\Nfirst digivolved into Skullgreymon?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.80,0:10:01.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At the time, I said it\Nwas the wrong thing to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.08,0:10:04.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the truth is, when it comes to\Ndigivolving, there's no right or wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.36,0:10:06.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A Digimon's destiny cannot be changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.64,0:10:08.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That day was a real eye-opener for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.88,0:10:11.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, I haven't been\Nable to open them since.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.60,0:10:13.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if that's the case,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.94,0:10:16.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then next time I'll just digivolve\Nmyself into the next Dark Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.00,0:10:18.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.78,0:10:25.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This sure brings back a lot of memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.06,0:10:31.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the exact spot where we spent\Nour first night here in the Digi-World.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.20,0:10:32.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.11,0:10:36.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is where Gabumon first digivolved\Ninto Garurumon and fought Seadramon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.30,0:10:39.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and this is the place where\NI fainted for the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.70,0:10:41.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, the first time in\Nthe Digi-World, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.92,0:10:45.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, it sure is great strolling\Ndown memory lane, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.52,0:10:50.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, do you think when we all get\Nback, we'll be some kind of heroes?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.58,0:10:53.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And win a whole bunch of awards,\Nlike an Emmy or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.82,0:10:54.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.94,0:10:55.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.85,0:10:56.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't be me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.96,0:10:58.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Open mouth, insert foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.36,0:10:59.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, we can always come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.84,0:11:00.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.90,0:11:01.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.10,0:11:02.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.01,0:11:05.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I forgot. Faux pas.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.64,0:11:08.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time passes differently\Nhere than in our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.12,0:11:10.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys will probably be long gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.02,0:11:13.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoops, there goes the other foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.32,0:11:14.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.80,0:11:18.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, we've still got a lot\Nof summer left I was thinking,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.78,0:11:22.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,maybe we could stay here until\Nour vacation's over Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.24,0:11:26.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a great idea! If Matt's\Nstaying, I'm staying too. Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.58,0:11:27.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that okay, Tai?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.18,0:11:33.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure. I'm staying too. Me too. We might\Nas well. We've got plenty of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.04,0:11:37.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since an entire day in the digital\Nworld is equal to just one minute
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.44,0:11:40.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in the real world And we've still\Ngot four weeks left of summer
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.20,0:11:44.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,vacation Then we can stay here in the\Ndigital world for up to let's see,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.74,0:11:46.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,carry the four, divide by three,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.60,0:11:48.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a really, really long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.42,0:11:52.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be precise, it's 40,320 days.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.24,0:11:53.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's about 110 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.00,0:11:55.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, we're staying! Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.22,0:11:58.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.90,0:12:01.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an eclipse.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.56,0:12:03.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.74,0:12:06.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there's something very important\Nyou should know about it, children.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.74,0:12:07.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.65,0:12:10.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not supposed to\Nlook directly into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.16,0:12:10.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.07,0:12:11.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.26,0:12:14.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This eclipse could cost you your lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.32,0:12:33.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean it's not an ordinary eclipse?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.76,0:12:37.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That shadow is the gate that connects\Nyour world to the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.82,0:12:41.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid the eclipse will\Nonly last for two more hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.50,0:12:42.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.86,0:12:45.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll just wait until\Nit opens up again Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.14,0:12:49.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,after all, we still have over a hundred\Nyears of summer vacation left Actually,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.62,0:12:50.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when Apocalymon appeared,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.04,0:12:53.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the flow of time here\Nand in your world became
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.50,0:12:56.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,synchronized So then we still\Nhave four weeks left, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.24,0:12:59.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's plenty of time to have fun
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.80,0:13:04.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, actually, you only have two hours.\NBecause once the portal is closed,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.08,0:13:06.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's closed forever But...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.14,0:13:08.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, it's time to say goodbye
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.20,0:13:12.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure gonna miss you,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.68,0:13:16.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora Say hi to your mom for me when\Nyou get back Sure I want to thank you,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.04,0:13:18.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bea Mom Before I met you,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.40,0:13:20.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't get along with my mom very well
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.24,0:13:22.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We argued She would\Nnever let me do anything
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.68,0:13:24.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But thanks to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.04,0:13:29.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand her a lot better You showed\Nme how much my mom really loves me
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.28,0:13:31.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.06,0:13:37.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course That makes me so happy\Nto hear you say that Sometimes I
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.62,0:13:41.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thought I was just bothering you and\Ngetting in your way all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.12,0:13:42.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.22,0:13:43.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You weren't a bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.13,0:13:44.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're my best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.34,0:13:46.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Beaumont, I'm gonna miss you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.44,0:13:55.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it's gonna be hard to find\Na friend as great as I am, Gomamon,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.56,0:13:57.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you'll have to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.76,0:13:58.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.04,0:14:00.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I took an ad out in the personals.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.00,0:14:03.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got five interviews\Nlined up for next week.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.58,0:14:04.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.50,0:14:08.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least let's shake\Nhands. Okay. For luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.06,0:14:12.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.72,0:14:16.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For someone without a hand,\Nyou've got a pretty strong grip.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.14,0:14:26.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tentomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.05,0:14:27.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, Izzy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.30,0:14:31.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something I need to\Ntell you before we part ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.28,0:14:32.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.19,0:14:33.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.02,0:14:35.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tentomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.93,0:14:36.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.18,0:14:41.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm fine, but I was a little taken\Naback by your sudden display of emotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.42,0:14:43.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.33,0:14:44.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.32,0:14:47.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't usually get emotional,\Nbut this was a unique occasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.64,0:14:48.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.66,0:14:49.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.68,0:14:52.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know how much our friendship has meant\Nto us, and in the name of our friendship,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.82,0:14:54.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to ask you one last favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.72,0:14:55.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.76,0:14:58.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you please turn off\Nthose windshield wipers?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.08,0:15:01.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure thing, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.22,0:15:02.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.66,0:15:03.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me a hug.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.50,0:15:05.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joking me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.36,0:15:10.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,T .K., please stop crying\Nbecause you're making me cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.96,0:15:13.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just crying because you were crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.00,0:15:18.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if you're crying because I'm crying,\Nand I'm crying because you're crying,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.34,0:15:21.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and neither one of us\Nneeds to be crying, can we?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.88,0:15:24.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh. Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.62,0:15:28.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, I'm sure we're gonna\Nsee each other again one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.44,0:15:32.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, just like we saw each other\Nagain after that thing with Debbie Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.26,0:15:33.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right, we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.56,0:15:34.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's make a pact.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.18,0:15:36.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll see each other again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.60,0:15:38.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Promise? Promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.88,0:15:46.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm. Hmm. Hmm. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.82,0:15:48.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.73,0:15:50.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That says it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.80,0:15:55.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't mind hearing you play\Nyour harmonica one last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.08,0:15:56.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Glad to.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.10,0:16:09.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stupid Matt, Izzy. What's the—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.82,0:16:16.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,matter nothing yeah sure hey come over
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.54,0:16:20.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,here and look at this this is the spot\Nwhere i first made my pepper breath
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.52,0:16:24.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,remember remember how could i ever\Nforget that's where you burned sidramon's
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.56,0:16:28.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,tail and he attacked us and your aim\Nhasn't gotten much better since then,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.30,0:16:29.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,either.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.96,0:16:32.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you don't really\Nbelieve that, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.94,0:16:35.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, look at the bright side.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.64,0:16:37.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your aim hasn't gotten any worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.40,0:16:38.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.52,0:16:43.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.60,0:16:45.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.51,0:16:46.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, let me put it on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.43,0:16:47.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doubles as a flea
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.18,0:16:49.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,collar.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.09,0:16:49.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Kari.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.01,0:16:51.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks good on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.70,0:16:52.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gee, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.00,0:16:54.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, I guess this is
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.52,0:16:56.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,goodbye. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.38,0:16:58.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Till next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.18,0:17:00.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next time?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.46,0:17:01.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.14,0:17:06.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Palmon, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.30,0:17:07.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.86,0:17:09.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.77,0:17:11.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Princess Mimi, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.18,0:17:12.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Palmon's disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.70,0:17:13.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you seen her?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.70,0:17:15.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not recently. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.90,0:17:19.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand how she\Ncould leave at a time like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.14,0:17:21.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's only a few minutes left.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.56,0:17:24.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Palmon, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.88,0:17:26.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm leaving soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.28,0:17:27.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.16,0:17:31.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you all finished\Nsaying your goodbyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.54,0:17:34.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can take this cable\Ncar home on one condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.94,0:17:39.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to promise to bring it back to\NSan Francisco, where I borrowed it from.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.48,0:17:40.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.44,0:17:44.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't we just have a little more time?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.62,0:17:46.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Jen, I do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.30,0:17:47.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Sora.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.74,0:17:49.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The gate won't wait any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.42,0:17:51.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.06,0:17:53.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Palmon seems to have disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.62,0:17:56.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would she run away? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.44,0:18:04.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, so that's where you're hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.54,0:18:06.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi's been looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.44,0:18:07.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.16,0:18:09.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I don't want to see her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.30,0:18:12.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand. It's simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.58,0:18:15.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I don't see her, then she\Ncan never say goodbye to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.34,0:18:17.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that what you really want?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.78,0:18:19.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid you'll regret it one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.78,0:18:21.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too painful to say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.88,0:18:24.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.40,0:18:26.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't wait for Palmon any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.72,0:18:27.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.04,0:18:29.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get on the cable car, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.02,0:18:31.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.80,0:18:42.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, guys, this is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.44,0:18:43.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What can I say?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:43.10,0:18:43.64,Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,200)\frz22.635\pos(288,142)}Dragon's Eye Lake
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.58,0:18:44.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try goodbye.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:43.64,0:18:44.68,Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(200,200)\frz22.635\pos(288,142)}Hikarigaoka
