Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.62,0:19:19.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi! I'm sorry! It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.42,0:19:20.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
