Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.74,0:20:22.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Champions of Digital World!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.54,0:20:30.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our adventure in the Digital\NWorld might be over for now,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.04,0:20:33.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but that gate won't stay closed forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.32,0:20:37.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a feeling that this won't be the\Nlast time we see our pals, the Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.88,0:20:38.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wait and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.00,0:20:43.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One day, that portal will open up again\Nand we'll return to the Digital World.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.32,0:20:45.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if Agumon will remember me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.80,0:20:47.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know I'll never forget him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.68,0:20:49.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or the rest of the Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.74,0:20:50.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,None of us will.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.68,0:21:23.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid of my future. I'm a
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.72,0:21:29.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Smile. I'm a smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.08,0:21:33.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a weak person.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.90,0:21:38.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a strong person. I'll be one more one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.46,0:21:40.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be one more. I'll
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.94,0:21:46.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be one more. I love you.
